{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19829","headline":"隐士 · 孟郊","name":"隐士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本末一相返，漂浮不还真。\n山野多馁士，市井无饥人。\n虎豹忌当道，麋鹿知藏身。\n奈何贪竞者，日与患害亲。\n颜貌岁岁改，利心朝朝新。\n孰知富生祸，取富不取贫。\n宝玉忌出璞，出璞先爲尘。\n松栢忌出山，出山先爲薪。\n君子隐石壁，道书爲我隣。\n寝兴思其义，澹泊味始真。\n陶公自放归，尚平去有依。\n草木择地生，禽鸟顺性飞。\n青青与冥冥，所保各不违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}